1
00:00:00,019 --> 00:00:01,632
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,634 --> 00:00:03,000
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,201 --> 00:00:04,814
(Episode 86)

4
00:00:04,996 --> 00:00:06,592
(In Surgery, Main Operating Room)

5
00:00:10,018 --> 00:00:12,685
Please tell us exactly what happened.

6
00:00:14,185 --> 00:00:17,326
Seung Hyun, Seung Woo, what's going on?

7
00:00:18,592 --> 00:00:21,211
What have you done?

8
00:00:21,213 --> 00:00:23,292
Was it that bastard?
Is he the one in surgery?

9
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,945
No.

10
00:00:26,138 --> 00:00:27,138
Ji Ni...

11
00:00:27,705 --> 00:00:28,959
Ji Ni's in surgery.

12
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,140
Ji Ni?

13
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:32,038
Why is Ji Ni there?

14
00:00:32,301 --> 00:00:33,467
Did she go there too?

15
00:00:33,507 --> 00:00:34,755
How did she find out?

16
00:00:35,531 --> 00:00:37,210
I told her.

17
00:00:37,498 --> 00:00:39,299
So they could settle it themselves.

18
00:00:40,299 --> 00:00:42,377
I told the kids not to go.

19
00:00:42,378 --> 00:00:45,340
You should've stopped her too.

20
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:47,494
I'm sorry.

21
00:00:48,346 --> 00:00:49,649
Everything went wrong.

22
00:00:50,152 --> 00:00:52,073
Ji Ni tried to stop him
from hurting Seung Hyun,

23
00:00:52,595 --> 00:00:54,087
and that bastard stabbed her.

24
00:00:54,678 --> 00:00:56,249
She was bleeding heavily
from her abdominal wound.

25
00:00:58,038 --> 00:01:00,872
Why would you go looking for him?

26
00:01:00,873 --> 00:01:02,739
He's a lunatic with a knife!

27
00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:04,167
I'm sorry.

28
00:01:04,985 --> 00:01:06,346
I had no choice but to go.

29
00:01:07,318 --> 00:01:08,746
If Ji Ni's in surgery,

30
00:01:09,436 --> 00:01:11,178
did that man get away?

31
00:01:12,812 --> 00:01:14,400
I'm not sure.

32
00:01:14,525 --> 00:01:15,921
The house caught fire...

33
00:01:17,579 --> 00:01:19,323
- A fire?
- Mr. Cha Seung Hyun.

34
00:01:19,925 --> 00:01:22,167
You admitted to unlawfully entering
Mr. Lee Cheol's residence while armed,

35
00:01:22,248 --> 00:01:24,394
and assaulting him, correct?

36
00:01:24,971 --> 00:01:27,033
We were informed
that an unidentified body...

37
00:01:27,081 --> 00:01:28,646
was found at the scene.

38
00:01:28,877 --> 00:01:31,826
A body? Are you saying he's dead?

39
00:01:35,178 --> 00:01:36,178
You are under arrest...

40
00:01:37,084 --> 00:01:40,685
for arson, arson resulting in death,
and aggravated assault.

41
00:01:41,498 --> 00:01:43,259
You have the right to an attorney,

42
00:01:43,261 --> 00:01:45,402
and the right to remain silent. However,

43
00:01:45,458 --> 00:01:46,919
anything you say from this moment on...

44
00:01:47,112 --> 00:01:49,394
may be used as evidence
in an investigation or trial.

45
00:01:50,398 --> 00:01:51,604
No.

46
00:01:52,162 --> 00:01:53,280
What's going on?

47
00:01:53,282 --> 00:01:55,180
Seung Hyun, did you set the fire?

48
00:01:55,795 --> 00:01:56,878
No.

49
00:01:57,278 --> 00:01:58,998
That bastard started the fire.

50
00:01:59,978 --> 00:02:02,492
There was already a gasoline can
right next to him.

51
00:02:02,558 --> 00:02:04,691
I'll go with you.

52
00:02:04,792 --> 00:02:05,920
I saw everything.

53
00:02:06,491 --> 00:02:07,686
Okay. Come with us.

54
00:02:07,752 --> 00:02:09,852
Please give us a detailed statement
at the police station.

55
00:02:09,932 --> 00:02:12,694
An unidentified body
was found at the scene,

56
00:02:13,051 --> 00:02:15,948
and you admitted that you went there
carrying a baseball bat...

57
00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:17,270
and assaulted him.

58
00:02:18,055 --> 00:02:19,055
Take him.

59
00:02:28,605 --> 00:02:29,605
What do we do?

60
00:02:31,826 --> 00:02:32,826
Yeong Ju.

61
00:02:32,878 --> 00:02:35,222
Mom, Seung Hyun didn't do it.

62
00:02:35,618 --> 00:02:37,017
I'll explain everything to them.

63
00:02:37,372 --> 00:02:38,728
He'll be out in no time.

64
00:03:03,911 --> 00:03:06,016
She gave my parents money...

65
00:03:06,445 --> 00:03:08,119
and told us to leave the neighborhood.

66
00:03:08,172 --> 00:03:11,382
She said not to turn myself in
or ever get caught.

67
00:03:12,112 --> 00:03:15,146
She wanted the injured boy's mom
and grandpa to suffer forever.

68
00:03:15,509 --> 00:03:17,020
She said she wanted revenge.

69
00:03:17,954 --> 00:03:19,033
That's a lie.

70
00:03:19,583 --> 00:03:20,732
It's a lie.

71
00:03:21,451 --> 00:03:24,103
Dad, I don't want to live anymore.

72
00:03:24,534 --> 00:03:26,025
Please don't save me.

73
00:03:26,945 --> 00:03:28,935
I'm sorry, Ji Hu.

74
00:03:29,686 --> 00:03:31,024
I'm so sorry.

75
00:03:34,965 --> 00:03:38,068
You went there because of
the hit-and-run 25 years ago, correct?

76
00:03:38,628 --> 00:03:41,413
Then what's your relationship...

77
00:03:41,447 --> 00:03:42,980
to the woman who's in surgery now?

78
00:03:45,109 --> 00:03:46,370
She's our younger sister.

79
00:03:47,051 --> 00:03:48,212
We're half-siblings.

80
00:03:49,275 --> 00:03:51,491
- Half-siblings.
- But I...

81
00:03:54,731 --> 00:03:57,301
I did go there for revenge.

82
00:03:58,549 --> 00:03:59,549
Seung Hyun.

83
00:03:59,954 --> 00:04:00,954
It's true.

84
00:04:01,265 --> 00:04:03,860
Ji Ni went there for her own reasons.
I went there for mine.

85
00:04:05,952 --> 00:04:08,539
But I didn't go there to kill him.

86
00:04:09,058 --> 00:04:11,838
I went to break his leg,
just like he did to my brother.

87
00:04:13,205 --> 00:04:16,126
Who was the first to enter the container?

88
00:04:16,285 --> 00:04:18,539
Tell us in detail what happened...

89
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,098
from the moment you went inside.

90
00:04:23,351 --> 00:04:25,319
When Ji Ni and I went in,

91
00:04:25,694 --> 00:04:27,638
Seung Hyun was already swinging the bat,

92
00:04:28,083 --> 00:04:31,108
and Lee Cheol was cornered,
begging for forgiveness.

93
00:04:31,330 --> 00:04:32,518
Then,

94
00:04:32,652 --> 00:04:34,498
Seung Hyun told me to call the police.

95
00:04:34,793 --> 00:04:36,202
But that bastard Lee Cheol...

96
00:04:36,357 --> 00:04:38,119
freaked out,
yelling not to call the police,

97
00:04:38,474 --> 00:04:41,598
then suddenly poured gasoline
on the floor and set it on fire.

98
00:04:41,812 --> 00:04:43,271
The fire spread in an instant,

99
00:04:43,498 --> 00:04:45,765
so we had to get out in a hurry.

100
00:04:45,767 --> 00:04:48,599
That'll be confirmed once
the forensic examination is complete.

101
00:04:50,205 --> 00:04:52,542
You admit to assaulting him, correct?

102
00:04:53,579 --> 00:04:54,579
Yes.

103
00:04:55,425 --> 00:04:56,996
I never intended to start a fire.

104
00:04:57,057 --> 00:04:58,283
That's right.

105
00:04:58,345 --> 00:05:00,313
After Seung Hyun got Ji Ni and me out,

106
00:05:00,375 --> 00:05:02,202
he went back in to try to save him,

107
00:05:02,407 --> 00:05:04,319
but then the container exploded.

108
00:05:04,741 --> 00:05:06,338
He didn't just leave him there to die.

109
00:05:07,791 --> 00:05:11,213
The fact that you went in
carrying a bat...

110
00:05:11,461 --> 00:05:14,207
gives us reason to suspect
you intended to kill him.

111
00:05:14,638 --> 00:05:16,415
No. That wasn't it.

112
00:05:30,735 --> 00:05:31,978
Ji Hu.

113
00:05:32,902 --> 00:05:35,454
I was going to do it.
Why are you cleaning?

114
00:05:35,692 --> 00:05:37,840
Your mom will make a fuss
if she sees this.

115
00:05:40,737 --> 00:05:42,782
Ji Ni's worried because you drink so much.

116
00:05:42,906 --> 00:05:44,424
That's nothing to worry about.

117
00:05:44,703 --> 00:05:46,026
I don't drink it all at once.

118
00:05:46,563 --> 00:05:47,563
What about Ji Ni?

119
00:05:48,592 --> 00:05:50,555
I didn't tell Ji Ni I was coming here.

120
00:05:51,354 --> 00:05:52,921
So she doesn't want to see me?

121
00:05:53,327 --> 00:05:54,327
That little brat.

122
00:05:54,991 --> 00:05:57,283
My aunt is staying
in Seo Chon for a while.

123
00:05:57,385 --> 00:05:58,680
She packed up and left.

124
00:05:59,017 --> 00:06:00,017
What?

125
00:06:00,452 --> 00:06:01,852
Because she doesn't want to see Ji Ni?

126
00:06:03,335 --> 00:06:04,925
How petty.

127
00:06:05,046 --> 00:06:07,339
She already yanked enough hair
out of my head.

128
00:06:07,405 --> 00:06:10,505
If she moves out,
your mom will get the wrong idea again.

129
00:06:10,935 --> 00:06:12,558
She'll start picking on Ji Ni again.

130
00:06:14,052 --> 00:06:15,335
I'll take good care of her.

131
00:06:17,078 --> 00:06:20,578
I hope she doesn't go to Seo Chon
and throw out all my things.

132
00:06:20,665 --> 00:06:22,294
I left a lot of stuff there.

133
00:06:22,549 --> 00:06:23,694
I'll bring it back.

134
00:06:31,176 --> 00:06:34,287
It's Seung Woo. Why is he calling?
Answer it.

135
00:06:36,631 --> 00:06:37,631
Hello?

136
00:06:38,995 --> 00:06:40,867
What? Ji Ni?

137
00:06:42,885 --> 00:06:44,722
Which hospital? I'll be right there.

138
00:06:46,747 --> 00:06:49,141
The hospital? What's wrong with Ji Ni?

139
00:06:49,938 --> 00:06:52,820
I think Ji Ni went to find that man.

140
00:06:54,194 --> 00:06:56,772
- She was stabbed...
- Stabbed?

141
00:07:00,245 --> 00:07:01,422
My goodness...

142
00:07:04,453 --> 00:07:06,908
(ICU 1)

143
00:07:08,898 --> 00:07:10,852
Seung Woo, why?

144
00:07:11,345 --> 00:07:12,892
Why was she stabbed?

145
00:07:13,078 --> 00:07:14,832
Why would you take her
somewhere so dangerous?

146
00:07:15,272 --> 00:07:16,272
Did you...

147
00:07:16,844 --> 00:07:18,907
take Ji Ni there on purpose?

148
00:07:19,652 --> 00:07:21,272
Do you think we're anything like you?

149
00:07:22,465 --> 00:07:24,503
How is she now?
Ji Ni's going to be okay, right?

150
00:07:26,587 --> 00:07:27,644
I don't know.

151
00:07:28,098 --> 00:07:29,715
They say the surgery went well,

152
00:07:30,456 --> 00:07:31,930
but she still hasn't
regained consciousness.

153
00:07:33,154 --> 00:07:34,154
What?

154
00:07:34,491 --> 00:07:36,644
Why? Why hasn't she woken up?

155
00:07:38,112 --> 00:07:40,227
They say some people take longer
to come out of anesthesia.

156
00:07:40,898 --> 00:07:42,327
They told us to wait a little longer.

157
00:07:42,638 --> 00:07:45,621
The doctor thinks it may be psychological.

158
00:07:46,369 --> 00:07:47,390
Psychological?

159
00:07:47,392 --> 00:07:49,506
They said trauma or stress...

160
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:52,651
can make the brain detach from reality.

161
00:07:53,810 --> 00:07:55,308
Ji Ni...

162
00:07:56,213 --> 00:07:57,541
Why would this happen to Ji Ni?

163
00:07:59,586 --> 00:08:01,280
Where's the doctor? I'll go ask.

164
00:08:01,394 --> 00:08:02,394
I need to hear it myself.

165
00:08:02,511 --> 00:08:05,632
Actually, the doctor was asking for you.

166
00:08:07,912 --> 00:08:09,725
This is all your fault!

167
00:08:10,125 --> 00:08:13,365
You're the one hurting Ji Ni the most.

168
00:08:14,752 --> 00:08:17,866
You paid Lee Cheol's family
to run away, didn't you?

169
00:08:20,171 --> 00:08:21,171
How did you...

170
00:08:23,125 --> 00:08:24,208
We heard everything.

171
00:08:24,870 --> 00:08:27,780
You wanted Mom and Grandpa to suffer.

172
00:08:27,912 --> 00:08:28,912
So...

173
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:31,003
you paid hundreds of thousands of dollars?

174
00:08:31,675 --> 00:08:33,005
You're unbelievable.

175
00:08:33,925 --> 00:08:36,338
How do you think Ji Ni felt
when she heard that?

176
00:08:36,578 --> 00:08:39,601
If anything happens to Ji Ni,
it'll be all your fault.

177
00:08:46,932 --> 00:08:48,028
Is that true?

178
00:08:48,298 --> 00:08:50,818
I wish it weren't.

179
00:08:52,612 --> 00:08:54,835
Where's that bastard Lee Cheol?

180
00:08:55,165 --> 00:08:56,336
That son of a bitch.

181
00:08:56,338 --> 00:08:58,831
I paid him all that money.
How could he tell you everything?

182
00:08:59,065 --> 00:09:01,037
Where is that damn bastard?

183
00:09:02,496 --> 00:09:03,496
He's dead.

184
00:09:05,992 --> 00:09:08,737
- He's dead?
- He set his own house on fire,

185
00:09:09,020 --> 00:09:10,559
and died because he couldn't get out.

186
00:09:10,718 --> 00:09:12,970
Tell me the truth. Is he really dead?

187
00:09:15,698 --> 00:09:16,899
Right now, Seung Hyun...

188
00:09:17,252 --> 00:09:18,978
is being investigated
for arson and murder.

189
00:09:19,478 --> 00:09:21,701
Everything you did 25 years ago...

190
00:09:22,135 --> 00:09:23,964
has brought us to this.

191
00:09:26,485 --> 00:09:28,643
I was just a kid
who wanted to follow my dad.

192
00:09:29,324 --> 00:09:31,042
You knocked me down in the road,

193
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:34,849
and left, pretending not to see
the motorcycle hit me.

194
00:09:36,223 --> 00:09:37,826
Then you even encouraged him to flee.

195
00:09:38,412 --> 00:09:39,488
You...

196
00:09:39,909 --> 00:09:41,455
What kind of person are you...

197
00:09:45,485 --> 00:09:47,941
Ji Ni, please.

198
00:10:10,758 --> 00:10:11,758
Okay.

199
00:10:12,879 --> 00:10:13,879
Thank you.

200
00:10:26,238 --> 00:10:27,648
Even you're going to act like this?

201
00:10:29,154 --> 00:10:31,792
I'm sorry. I'm so confused.

202
00:10:33,295 --> 00:10:34,659
Twenty-five years.

203
00:10:35,556 --> 00:10:37,370
It's been 25 years!

204
00:10:38,172 --> 00:10:41,442
How much longer must I live
with people pointing fingers at me?

205
00:10:41,705 --> 00:10:44,135
How long do I have to keep
getting my hair pulled?

206
00:10:45,632 --> 00:10:47,034
Tell me.

207
00:10:47,138 --> 00:10:49,105
Should I have never had Ji Ni...

208
00:10:49,106 --> 00:10:50,882
and run away to Europe instead?

209
00:10:52,887 --> 00:10:54,005
Get some rest.

210
00:10:55,245 --> 00:10:57,816
If I could go back,
I'd still want revenge.

211
00:10:58,232 --> 00:11:01,331
Thinking about it still makes me furious.

212
00:11:02,351 --> 00:11:04,045
As for Yeong Ju and that old man...

213
00:11:04,442 --> 00:11:06,511
I thought, "Go on. Search all you want."

214
00:11:06,651 --> 00:11:09,335
"Keep circling the neighborhood."

215
00:11:10,967 --> 00:11:12,658
That's all it was, Ji Hu.

216
00:11:13,631 --> 00:11:16,655
I really didn't know
things would turn out this way.

217
00:11:36,211 --> 00:11:39,127
You evil bitch.

218
00:11:40,745 --> 00:11:41,905
Father.

219
00:11:43,085 --> 00:11:44,498
So this bitch was the one...

220
00:11:45,057 --> 00:11:46,452
who left Seung Woo broken...

221
00:11:47,379 --> 00:11:49,221
and tormented us all these years.

222
00:11:50,222 --> 00:11:53,044
Father, I'm so furious.

223
00:12:23,091 --> 00:12:24,091
What about Ji Ni?

224
00:12:24,119 --> 00:12:25,254
Ji Hu is with her.

225
00:12:35,215 --> 00:12:37,669
(Haemyeong University Hospital)

226
00:13:11,725 --> 00:13:14,071
Her abdominal injury caused
severe internal bleeding,

227
00:13:14,212 --> 00:13:16,193
and she miscarried during surgery.

228
00:13:17,968 --> 00:13:19,205
She was pregnant?

229
00:13:19,545 --> 00:13:22,669
It was still early.
Neither of you probably knew.

230
00:13:22,989 --> 00:13:24,123
I'm sorry for your loss.

231
00:13:24,705 --> 00:13:27,322
The stabbing caused
severe abdominal injuries.

232
00:13:27,391 --> 00:13:30,077
The anesthesia and emergency treatment
she needed during surgery...

233
00:13:30,600 --> 00:13:32,178
made it difficult to save the baby.

234
00:13:41,505 --> 00:13:42,703
Ji Ni.

235
00:13:46,058 --> 00:13:47,226
What do we do now?

236
00:13:51,352 --> 00:13:52,418
Ji Ni.

237
00:14:17,578 --> 00:14:18,578
Mom.

238
00:14:19,099 --> 00:14:20,713
Don't you think we should see Ji Ni?

239
00:14:21,273 --> 00:14:23,769
She did get stabbed protecting Seung Hyun.

240
00:14:25,366 --> 00:14:26,680
I'm still thinking about it.

241
00:14:27,912 --> 00:14:30,198
How can a mother and daughter
be so different?

242
00:14:30,372 --> 00:14:31,690
It makes things so confusing.

243
00:14:32,877 --> 00:14:34,024
It really does.

244
00:14:35,298 --> 00:14:36,385
Are you okay, Mom?

245
00:14:36,965 --> 00:14:38,549
What if I'm not? What choice do I have?

246
00:14:39,145 --> 00:14:40,705
Eat up. We need to see Seung Hyun.

247
00:14:42,338 --> 00:14:43,338
Mom.

248
00:14:44,209 --> 00:14:45,209
Seung Hyun...

249
00:14:45,913 --> 00:14:47,343
didn't kill anyone.

250
00:14:48,093 --> 00:14:51,587
Uncle and I will get to the truth,
so don't worry too much.

251
00:14:53,589 --> 00:14:54,699
What about the assault?

252
00:14:55,198 --> 00:14:57,183
He'll be punished for that.

253
00:14:57,745 --> 00:15:00,344
But they'll consider the circumstances.

254
00:15:00,899 --> 00:15:02,051
Find him a lawyer.

255
00:15:10,772 --> 00:15:11,956
What?

256
00:15:14,358 --> 00:15:16,561
Did I hear that right?

257
00:15:17,085 --> 00:15:19,291
The man who injured Seung Woo's leg,

258
00:15:19,292 --> 00:15:21,471
that man, Lee Cheol...

259
00:15:22,346 --> 00:15:23,586
Our in-law...

260
00:15:24,062 --> 00:15:25,519
No, she doesn't deserve that title.

261
00:15:25,805 --> 00:15:27,752
I mean, Ji Ni's mom...

262
00:15:28,597 --> 00:15:29,707
My goodness.

263
00:15:30,085 --> 00:15:32,886
Why was I the only one who didn't know?

264
00:15:32,965 --> 00:15:34,630
I only found out recently too.

265
00:15:34,849 --> 00:15:36,416
This is unbelievable.

266
00:15:37,225 --> 00:15:41,081
How could you lend 200,000 dollars
to a woman like that?

267
00:15:41,725 --> 00:15:43,545
Do you have money to throw away?

268
00:15:43,546 --> 00:15:46,424
She's family.
Helping her was the right thing to do.

269
00:15:47,225 --> 00:15:49,668
But I wouldn't have helped
if I'd known how it was all connected.

270
00:15:49,670 --> 00:15:53,167
You call her family?
She can't afford to pay it back!

271
00:15:53,525 --> 00:15:56,445
When you see her,
don't show that you know. Okay?

272
00:15:56,498 --> 00:15:58,817
That family is truly awful.

273
00:15:58,925 --> 00:16:01,617
How did we end up related
to a family like that?

274
00:16:04,037 --> 00:16:06,027
They're the worst of the worst.

275
00:16:06,886 --> 00:16:09,617
Let's be honest. She's a criminal.

276
00:16:09,685 --> 00:16:11,530
Don't say that in front of Ji Ni.

277
00:16:11,532 --> 00:16:13,140
Why shouldn't I?

278
00:16:13,865 --> 00:16:15,540
This is her punishment.

279
00:16:15,705 --> 00:16:17,906
The daughter is paying
for what her mother did.

280
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:19,981
- I told you.
- Honey.

281
00:16:19,983 --> 00:16:21,767
Stop being so protective of her.

282
00:16:22,105 --> 00:16:24,412
This won't heal.
We should cut her out now.

283
00:16:24,905 --> 00:16:26,465
I told you to watch what you say.

284
00:16:26,492 --> 00:16:28,320
And you need to see both sides.

285
00:16:28,858 --> 00:16:31,424
Is Ji Ni the only one who's family?
What about Yeong Ju?

286
00:16:31,905 --> 00:16:33,778
She's your brother's wife.

287
00:16:33,845 --> 00:16:35,951
Yeong Ju is the actual victim.

288
00:16:36,052 --> 00:16:38,433
Ji Ni is the offender's daughter.

289
00:16:38,825 --> 00:16:41,258
You should be protecting the victim more.

290
00:16:41,365 --> 00:16:42,365
Don't you agree?

291
00:16:42,698 --> 00:16:44,331
That's true.

292
00:16:45,058 --> 00:16:46,631
What have I been saying?

293
00:16:47,545 --> 00:16:50,253
An abandoned wife
is better than a mistress.

294
00:16:51,130 --> 00:16:54,798
Though they both disgrace our family.

295
00:17:07,032 --> 00:17:08,668
Honey, come back to me.

296
00:17:09,945 --> 00:17:11,010
Don't leave me.

297
00:17:17,345 --> 00:17:19,226
- Ji Hu.
- You came.

298
00:17:20,712 --> 00:17:22,181
Ji Ni hasn't woken up yet.

299
00:17:23,372 --> 00:17:24,816
The doctor said...

300
00:17:25,025 --> 00:17:26,970
she should wake up in the morning.

301
00:17:28,765 --> 00:17:30,603
What on earth happened?

302
00:17:31,065 --> 00:17:32,245
Why was Ji Ni stabbed?

303
00:17:32,722 --> 00:17:33,967
There's a lot to explain.

304
00:17:34,358 --> 00:17:35,508
Later, once Ji Ni wakes up.

305
00:17:36,855 --> 00:17:38,010
Did you get any sleep?

306
00:17:39,865 --> 00:17:42,474
You haven't eaten, have you?
Let's go get something.

307
00:17:43,230 --> 00:17:45,093
No. She could wake up any minute.

308
00:17:45,245 --> 00:17:47,301
I'll stay with her. You can go.

309
00:17:47,854 --> 00:17:49,404
Come on. Let's go.

310
00:17:50,432 --> 00:17:51,655
Take care of her, Jung A.

311
00:17:52,772 --> 00:17:54,301
Call me right away if anything's wrong.

312
00:17:54,308 --> 00:17:55,399
Don't worry.

313
00:17:56,062 --> 00:17:57,062
Let's go.

314
00:18:08,685 --> 00:18:10,358
My poor friend.

315
00:18:11,845 --> 00:18:14,303
Why does misfortune
always follow you around?

316
00:18:40,905 --> 00:18:41,905
Yes? What is it?

317
00:18:43,529 --> 00:18:44,652
Lawyer's fees?

318
00:18:45,038 --> 00:18:46,851
I need to transfer 5,000 dollars
right away.

319
00:18:47,172 --> 00:18:48,732
This case is bigger than I thought, Mom.

320
00:18:49,012 --> 00:18:50,496
Arson and murder.

321
00:18:50,831 --> 00:18:52,421
We have to prove Seung Hyun
didn't set the fire or kill anyone.

322
00:18:53,365 --> 00:18:56,187
Okay. I'll send the money right away.

323
00:19:02,605 --> 00:19:05,847
Father, please help me.

324
00:20:02,911 --> 00:20:04,593
Hey, Mom. Did you transfer the money?

325
00:20:04,627 --> 00:20:05,627
No.

326
00:20:05,738 --> 00:20:08,122
Seung Woo, have you seen my gold?

327
00:20:08,124 --> 00:20:09,124
Gold?

328
00:20:09,645 --> 00:20:11,619
You had it. I've never even seen it.

329
00:20:12,430 --> 00:20:13,712
The gold is gone.

330
00:20:13,958 --> 00:20:15,871
I put it in the storage room
when I got married.

331
00:20:16,837 --> 00:20:17,837
Really?

332
00:20:18,205 --> 00:20:19,500
What's going on?

333
00:20:20,057 --> 00:20:22,862
Okay. I'll ask for more time
to pay the deposit and come over.

334
00:20:36,798 --> 00:20:37,917
Na Se Ri.

335
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:39,694
Na Se Ri.

336
00:20:39,754 --> 00:20:43,101
Did she really take this too?

337
00:20:48,485 --> 00:20:49,485
Ma'am.

338
00:20:53,294 --> 00:20:54,342
Yeah, Jung A.

339
00:20:54,753 --> 00:20:55,753
When did you get here?

340
00:20:55,984 --> 00:20:57,846
- Did you see Ji Hu?
- Yes.

341
00:20:57,992 --> 00:20:59,885
He went out to eat with Tae O.

342
00:21:05,858 --> 00:21:07,521
Sun Kyung, you're here.

343
00:21:07,635 --> 00:21:08,774
And you too, Jung A.

344
00:21:09,520 --> 00:21:10,895
Has Ji Hu left?

345
00:21:14,012 --> 00:21:16,323
- Why are you looking at me like that?
- It's nothing.

346
00:21:17,192 --> 00:21:19,080
What's the point of bringing it up?
It's all in the past.

347
00:21:20,865 --> 00:21:22,958
Thank you for saying that.

348
00:21:27,078 --> 00:21:28,575
I told Ji Hu this too,

349
00:21:29,334 --> 00:21:31,553
but Ji Ni hasn't done anything wrong.

350
00:21:33,032 --> 00:21:36,251
She's a really good person.

351
00:21:39,498 --> 00:21:40,498
Na Se Ri!

352
00:21:41,218 --> 00:21:42,218
Yeong Ju.

353
00:21:43,702 --> 00:21:45,030
- Come with me!
- What's wrong with you?

354
00:21:45,032 --> 00:21:47,493
- Come with me!
- Yeong Ju, what are you doing? Let go!

355
00:21:48,960 --> 00:21:50,361
Are you even human?

356
00:21:50,651 --> 00:21:52,078
How dare you come into my home...

357
00:21:52,164 --> 00:21:54,263
pretending to be human
and pull a stunt like this?

358
00:21:54,265 --> 00:21:56,898
You're still upset? What about me?

359
00:21:57,085 --> 00:21:59,071
Have you even thought
about what you did to me?

360
00:21:59,072 --> 00:22:00,545
I even let it slide...

361
00:22:00,671 --> 00:22:03,326
when you told that bastard
to mess with Father and me.

362
00:22:03,838 --> 00:22:04,838
And then...

363
00:22:05,367 --> 00:22:07,009
I couldn't stop thinking about Ji Ni.

364
00:22:07,270 --> 00:22:09,740
She got stabbed instead of Seung Hyun
even though she was innocent!

365
00:22:09,742 --> 00:22:12,722
Fine. Then whose fault is it
that she's lying there now?

366
00:22:13,903 --> 00:22:14,903
You...

367
00:22:16,432 --> 00:22:17,909
What did you do with my gold?

368
00:22:19,742 --> 00:22:20,742
What?

369
00:22:22,317 --> 00:22:23,816
- Your gold?
- Did you sell it...

370
00:22:23,818 --> 00:22:25,085
to pay that bastard off?

371
00:22:25,958 --> 00:22:29,005
The wedding gift? That 100,000 dollars?

372
00:22:32,218 --> 00:22:34,338
Did you steal to pay for her wedding?

373
00:22:35,179 --> 00:22:37,010
No! That's not true!

374
00:22:37,198 --> 00:22:39,255
No! It was mine to begin with!

375
00:22:39,432 --> 00:22:40,633
Let's be honest.

376
00:22:40,813 --> 00:22:42,796
How much spending money did you give them?

377
00:22:42,798 --> 00:22:44,051
Not a dime, right?

378
00:22:44,158 --> 00:22:46,291
You were too busy paying
Seung Woo's hospital bills.

379
00:22:46,512 --> 00:22:48,567
And you inherited the in-laws' house,

380
00:22:48,728 --> 00:22:50,465
while I paid for the kids' tuition.

381
00:22:50,605 --> 00:22:53,644
His salary wasn't much,
so I gave lessons morning and evening,

382
00:22:53,665 --> 00:22:55,505
and we lived off my savings.

383
00:22:55,725 --> 00:22:58,079
That gold isn't yours! It's mine!

384
00:22:58,730 --> 00:22:59,812
Unbelievable!

385
00:23:00,252 --> 00:23:02,212
How can you be so shameless?

386
00:23:02,412 --> 00:23:04,212
Do you know how hard I worked
to save that gold?

387
00:23:06,252 --> 00:23:08,196
You even got my son handcuffed!

388
00:23:09,170 --> 00:23:10,928
And what about my daughter?

389
00:23:10,929 --> 00:23:12,718
She got stabbed in the stomach
and is lying there now!

390
00:23:12,719 --> 00:23:14,022
Then we're even!

391
00:23:14,036 --> 00:23:15,036
You!

392
00:23:17,258 --> 00:23:18,795
I told you not to touch me!

393
00:23:18,925 --> 00:23:20,492
I'm done letting you hit me!

394
00:23:20,871 --> 00:23:23,324
If you'd treated me like a human being
25 years ago,

395
00:23:23,326 --> 00:23:24,868
or even treated Ji Ni like one,

396
00:23:24,869 --> 00:23:26,498
I never would've gone this far!

397
00:23:27,445 --> 00:23:29,541
Aunt. Mother.

398
00:23:30,252 --> 00:23:31,560
Everything you stole,

399
00:23:32,448 --> 00:23:34,578
I'll make you pay it all back.
Just you wait!

400
00:23:34,579 --> 00:23:35,850
It's mine!

401
00:23:36,011 --> 00:23:37,616
It was mine to begin with!

402
00:23:38,117 --> 00:23:39,780
Mother, that's enough.
Come with me. Let's go.

403
00:23:39,881 --> 00:23:41,762
Let go! Where am I supposed to go?

404
00:23:42,359 --> 00:23:44,615
This is my daughter's hospital room.
Why should I leave?

405
00:23:44,617 --> 00:23:48,331
You leave, Yeong Ju! All of you, get out!

406
00:23:50,351 --> 00:23:53,518
I feel so sorry for Ji Ni,
having you as her mom.

407
00:23:53,772 --> 00:23:55,503
You're not fit to be a mother!

408
00:23:58,838 --> 00:23:59,838
Aunt.

409
00:24:35,292 --> 00:24:37,828
Nothing beats watching a fight up close.

410
00:24:37,986 --> 00:24:38,986
Right, Jung A?

411
00:24:39,891 --> 00:24:41,611
I just can't believe it.

412
00:24:42,098 --> 00:24:43,945
Did Ji Ni's mom really do that?

413
00:24:44,005 --> 00:24:47,112
That's why you need to make
the right choice from the start.

414
00:24:47,505 --> 00:24:50,391
If you start off on the wrong foot,
you should quit while you can.

415
00:24:50,472 --> 00:24:52,791
Keep it up,
and you'll be a laughingstock for life.

416
00:24:53,718 --> 00:24:56,738
I really admired and liked Ji Ni's mom.

417
00:24:56,785 --> 00:24:58,501
Couldn't you find anyone better to admire?

418
00:24:58,502 --> 00:24:59,513
Admire me instead.

419
00:25:01,766 --> 00:25:02,766
Well, Jung A.

420
00:25:03,272 --> 00:25:05,603
Have you made up your mind now?

421
00:25:06,298 --> 00:25:09,646
You'll have to step in
and save Ji Hu and Ji Ni, won't you?

422
00:25:10,534 --> 00:25:13,191
- Me?
- You saw Ji Hu yourself.

423
00:25:13,258 --> 00:25:16,797
He's worried sick.
I almost feel sorry for him.

424
00:25:16,965 --> 00:25:19,265
He's having a really hard time right now.

425
00:25:19,612 --> 00:25:20,990
Just wait until Ji Ni wakes up.

426
00:25:21,076 --> 00:25:22,612
It'll be a nightmare all over again.

427
00:25:23,675 --> 00:25:24,675
You have to save them.

428
00:25:25,971 --> 00:25:28,421
Save Ji Ni?

429
00:25:28,495 --> 00:25:29,495
Exactly.

430
00:25:30,132 --> 00:25:33,023
How can she live under the same roof
with Yeong Ju?

431
00:25:33,257 --> 00:25:34,257
Right?

432
00:25:34,745 --> 00:25:37,425
Besides, our family is quite well-off.

433
00:25:38,032 --> 00:25:39,524
Your future father-in-law...

434
00:25:39,594 --> 00:25:41,825
is a very capable and wealthy man.

435
00:25:42,651 --> 00:25:45,347
Why do you think Do Hee was so desperate
to marry into our family?

436
00:25:45,835 --> 00:25:46,835
You get it, right?

437
00:25:52,652 --> 00:25:54,370
Ma'am, have some of this.

438
00:25:54,371 --> 00:25:56,321
Okay. Thanks.

439
00:25:58,811 --> 00:26:00,756
Why are you blinking
like you've been electrocuted?

440
00:26:01,598 --> 00:26:02,755
I'm not.

441
00:26:03,258 --> 00:26:06,458
What's he doing
in Lieutenant No's room anyway?

442
00:26:06,738 --> 00:26:08,277
Is Lieutenant No hospitalized too?

443
00:26:08,305 --> 00:26:09,440
You didn't know?

444
00:26:10,112 --> 00:26:11,640
He was stabbed too.

445
00:26:18,972 --> 00:26:21,161
Hey, snap out of it!

446
00:26:23,090 --> 00:26:24,090
Okay.

447
00:26:40,218 --> 00:26:42,141
Ji Ni, are you okay?

448
00:26:43,149 --> 00:26:44,308
I'll get the doctor.

449
00:27:00,738 --> 00:27:02,300
Are you feeling any discomfort?

450
00:27:02,658 --> 00:27:04,554
Take a deep breath for me.

451
00:27:08,225 --> 00:27:11,078
My stomach hurts so much.

452
00:27:13,038 --> 00:27:14,809
As I explained this morning,

453
00:27:14,810 --> 00:27:17,542
she had severe internal bleeding
from abdominal trauma.

454
00:27:17,930 --> 00:27:20,255
Unfortunately, she miscarried
during surgery.

455
00:27:28,465 --> 00:27:29,648
We had no idea.

456
00:27:30,202 --> 00:27:31,321
There was nothing they could do.

457
00:27:35,951 --> 00:27:38,374
Did you know?

458
00:27:42,452 --> 00:27:43,564
I had my suspicions,

459
00:27:45,140 --> 00:27:48,042
so I was going to wait a few more days
before taking a test.

460
00:27:50,392 --> 00:27:52,752
If you suspected it,
how could you go somewhere so dangerous?

461
00:27:54,265 --> 00:27:56,487
She's tough.
I wonder who she gets that from.

462
00:27:57,282 --> 00:27:58,282
Honey.

463
00:28:40,305 --> 00:28:43,662
(Family Register)

464
00:28:43,740 --> 00:28:45,516
I'm giving you a chance.

465
00:28:45,517 --> 00:28:47,049
Are you really going
to take this all the way?

466
00:28:47,052 --> 00:28:49,645
They also need proof
that he didn't break that guy's leg.

467
00:28:49,646 --> 00:28:51,806
Didn't he say in the initial statement
that he went there to break his leg?

468
00:28:51,807 --> 00:28:53,692
If someone could just step in
and put an end to this,

469
00:28:53,694 --> 00:28:55,573
wouldn't we both be better off and free?

470
00:28:55,575 --> 00:28:57,757
Jeon Jung A,
are you really going to do this?

471
00:28:57,758 --> 00:28:59,468
You look like you've made up your mind.
Spit it out.

472
00:28:59,470 --> 00:29:00,711
I'm done with Mom.

473
00:29:00,778 --> 00:29:02,305
I can't put up with her anymore.

474
00:29:04,639 --> 00:29:06,639
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
